    {
      "id": 122303,
      "type": "Ultimate",
      "name": { "en": "Dash In, Gash Out", "zh-CN": "锋入幽渺，影出凌厉" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Deals Lightning DMG equal to #1[i]% of Moze's ATK to one designated enemy target, and launches the Talent's Follow-Up ATK against this target. If the target is defeated before this Follow-Up ATK is used, then launches the Follow-Up ATK against a random single enemy instead.",
        "zh-CN": "对指定敌方单体造成等同于貊泽#1[i]%攻击力的雷属性伤害，并对该目标发动天赋的追加攻击。若本次追加攻击施放前目标被消灭则对敌方随机单体发动追加攻击。"
      },
