      "description": {
        "en": "After using Technique, enters the Stealth state for #1[i] second(s). While in Stealth, Moze is undetectable by enemies. If Moze attacks enemies to enter combat while in Stealth, increases DMG by #2[i]%, lasting for #3[i] turn(s).",
        "zh-CN": "使用秘技后进入持续#1[i]秒的隐身状态。隐身状态下不会被敌人发现，貊泽在隐身状态下攻击敌人进入战斗时伤害提高#2[i]%，持续#3[i]回合。"
